## 7. THREE-LAYER TACTICAL VALIDATION ENGINE

Implement three completely separate validation layers.

### Layer 1 — FC IQ Legal Compatibility

Determine whether a combination is legal according to FC26:

- Canonical player position.
- Formation slot.
- Player Role.
- Player Focus.
- Squad eligibility.

This layer may block invalid configurations.

Preserve all Phase 2.2 position normalization and squad eligibility logic.

Never allow AI to recommend illegal position-role-focus combinations.

### Layer 2 — Official Tactical Vision Requirements

EA SPORTS FC26 has relaxed Tactical Vision restrictions compared with FC25.

Implement the following baseline mandatory requirements from official Career Mode documentation:

- Standard: no specific Build-Up Style or Defensive Approach requirement.
- Possession: Close Support, corresponding to Short Passing terminology where verified.
- Wing Play: Balanced or Counter Build-Up Style.
- Counter Attack: Counter Build-Up Style.
- Park the Bus: Deep Defensive Approach.
- Kick and Rush: Balanced Defensive Approach.
- High Pressing: High or Aggressive Defensive Approach.

Verify actual in-game terminology and normalize equivalent labels.

In particular:

- Close Support versus Short Passing.
- Aggressive versus Extreme.
- Kick and Rush versus Kick & Rush.
- Wing Play versus Wing-Play.

Do not assume a numerical Defensive Line Height range unless supported by verified FC26 data.

Do not silently invent restrictions.

When a tactical configuration violates an official Tactical Vision requirement:

- Display the conflict.
- Explain which setting must change.
- Allow the user to keep it as a draft or an application-level custom tactic.
- Do not label it as a verified vision-compliant configuration.
- Provide an explicit correction action.

Never silently change the user's selected settings.

### Layer 3 — Tactical Vision Role Affinity

Player Roles are no longer mandatory Tactical Vision requirements in FC26.

Implement Role Affinity as advisory information.

A role that is not associated with the selected Tactical Vision must remain selectable when it is legal for the position.

Do not block the user from creating unconventional football tactics.

Example:

A Possession tactic can legally use a Poacher instead of a False 9.

The application must distinguish:

- Legal FC IQ role.
- Role associated with the selected Tactical Vision.
- Potential coach familiarity bonus.
- Tactical recommendation based on observed gameplay.

Do not confuse these concepts.

