### Intended Tactical Vision

The philosophy selected by the user before the match.

### Observed Playing Style

The football behavior supported by recorded gameplay evidence.

### Recommended Tactical Vision

The tactical direction recommended for the current match situation.

Observed Playing Style does not need to match exactly one Tactical Vision.

